      "content": "Two trolleys, X (mass m) and Y (mass 2m), start at rest with a compressed spring between them. The spring is released, and they move apart on a frictionless floor. What is the magnitude of X's momentum? A) zero B) half of Y's C) twice Y's D) the same as Y's"
